{"id":"gamefreak-lineblog-2463891","kind":"blog","title":"【日记】2016年宝可梦中心头图拍摄","display_title":null,"dek":null,"date":"2016-03-31","publication":"増田順一 公式ブログ · ヘッダー！","issue":null,"interviewee":[],"people":[{"name":"增田顺一","slug":"masuda-junichi"}],"works":[],"era":null,"url":"https://docs.pokeamice.com/gamefreak-director/lineblog-2463891/","body_kind":"markdown","segment_count":null,"cover":null,"archive_type":"gamefreak_masuda_lineblog","summary":"为了制作博客头图，增田顺一请宝可梦中心与员工协力，在闭店后的池袋店拍摄皮卡丘，记录一张照片诞生的幕后。","interviewer":null,"translator":null,"tags":["Game Freak","增田顺一","LINE BLOG","ものづくり"],"original_lang":null,"translation_status":"openai-machine-translated","source":{"title":"増田順一 公式ブログ · ヘッダー！","url":"https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/2463891.html","archive_url":"https://web.archive.org/web/20160403144106id_/https://lineblog.me/masudajunichi/archives/2463891.html","type":"official_blog_wayback"},"body":{"kind":"markdown","markdown_zh":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">苦恼了好一阵。</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">我觉得头图非常重要，</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">于是向位于池袋阳光城的</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">宝可梦中心 Mega东京</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">发出了协力请求！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br>\n\n<br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">然后说到摄影师，\n    <br>\n要是在 GAME FREAK 拍人物，\n    <br>\n就得找这位！\n    <br>\n于是请来了 MT！\n    <br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n相当内部（笑）\n    <br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\nMega东京店铺关门之后\n    <br>\n皮卡丘大量出现（笑）\n    <br>\n\n<br>\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2463891/001-31587f0996.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2463891/001-31587f0996.webp\" alt=\"752A1088\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\"></a></figure>\n<br>\n\n<br>\n这个布局\n    <br>\n真的超帅吧！\n    <br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2463891/002-605fb2a7f8.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2463891/002-605fb2a7f8.webp\" alt=\"752A1087\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"></a></figure>\n<br>\n于是拍下了照片！\n    <br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2463891/003-4750226121.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2463891/003-4750226121.webp\" alt=\"752A1123\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"></a></figure>\n<br>\n还有这样的！我喜欢这个构图！\n    <br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2463891/004-866db8adcb.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2463891/004-866db8adcb.webp\" alt=\"752A1101\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1067\" height=\"1600\"></a></figure>\n<br>\nMT还会告诉你\n    <br>\n能让人露出笑容的魔法话语（笑）\n    <br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2463891/005-6d70970de4.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2463891/005-6d70970de4.webp\" alt=\"752A1068\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\"></a></figure>\n<br>\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2463891/006-d67765fdd6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2463891/006-d67765fdd6.webp\" alt=\"752A1059\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\"></a></figure>\n<br>\n\n<br>\n施展魔法之后！笑容！（笑）\n    <br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2463891/007-de37df06de.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2463891/007-de37df06de.webp\" alt=\"752A1045\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\"></a></figure>\n<br>\n就这样，\n    <br>\n头图制作完成了！\n    <br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n看似简单的一张照片，\n    <br>\n却包含了许多要素，\n    <br>\n许多人的协力，\n    <br>\n以及磨炼出的品味。\n    <br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n还有，\n    <br>\n感谢 Mega东京，\n    <br>\n为我们创造了与平时不同的日常！\n    <br>\n\n<br>\n也感谢\n    <br>\n帮忙拍照的 MT！\n    <br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n大家齐心协力，\n    <br>\n制作出了这一张头图！感谢！\n    <br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n真的非常感谢！！！\n    <br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2463891/008-a3fb85a24d.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2463891/008-a3fb85a24d.webp\" alt=\"752A1018\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"1067\"></a></figure>附赠！\n    <br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br></div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">悩みまくりました。</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ヘッダーは大切だなと思い</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">池袋サンシャインシティにある</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ポケモンセンター メガトウキョーに</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">協力依頼！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br>\n\n<br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">そしてカメラマンは\n    <br>\nゲームフリークで人物を\n    <br>\n撮らせたらこのひと！\n    <br>\nMTに依頼！\n    <br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\nかなりの内輪（笑）\n    <br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\n\n<br>\nメガトウキョーのお店がクローズした後\n    <br>\nピカチュウ大量発生（笑）\n    <br>\n\n<br>\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2463891/001-31587f0996.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/2463891/001-31587f09